{"id":"23.03.ShaderGenshin","contentHtml":"<p>This project is a <strong>technical research</strong> and demonstration of skills in writing custom shaders and post-effects for <code>Built-In Render Pipeline</code>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> deconstruct and recreate from scratch in Unity a complex render forming the recognizable visual style of the game Genshin Impact.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>1. Multi-component Character Shader</h2>\n<p>A flexible shader was written from scratch, including the following techniques:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cel-Shading:</strong> Implemented lighting model with <code>ramp-texture</code> to create characteristic \"anime\" shadows.</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Face Shadows (<code>Face Shadow</code>):</strong> Implemented a system projecting a shadow on the character's face depending on the light source direction using a special texture mask.</li>\n<li><strong>Anisotropic Hair Highlights:</strong> Created an effect of elongated highlights simulating light reflection from hair strands.</li>\n<li><strong>Stylized Effects:</strong> Added controlled highlights for metal (<code>Metallic</code>), general reflection (<code>Specular</code>), and contour lighting (<code>Rim Light</code>) to separate the model from the background.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2. Outline Post-Effect</h2>\n<p>To create the final look, a <strong>custom post-process</strong> was developed that draws an outline on the entire scene:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Scene Analysis:</strong> The effect works based on analyzing depth (<code>Depth</code>) and normal (<code>Normals</code>) buffers of the entire scene.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexible Setup:</strong> Allows controlling thickness, color, and sensitivity of the outline to depth changes and normal changes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This project demonstrates a <mark>complex approach to stylized rendering</mark>, combining object-oriented shaders and post-processing techniques.</p>\n","published":true,"title":"Shader Genshin","date":"2023-03","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Unity","C#","HLSL"],"heroVideo":["YFuYXEFwq3E"],"shortDescription":"<p>Tech demo: <mark>Comprehensive recreation of the rendering style</mark> of Genshin Impact for <code>Built-In RP</code>. Implemented a multi-component shader and an outline post-effect.</p>\n","role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/23.03.ShaderGenshin/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/23.03.ShaderGenshin/card.mp4?v=1765046937551","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/23.03.ShaderGenshin/screenshots/01.webp","width":962,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/23.03.ShaderGenshin/screenshots/02.webp","width":962,"height":936}]}